JOURYVEL BRAND BIBLE v32
===========================

BRAND STORY
============
"JOURYVEL - Perfume Maison"
Founded in Casablanca, Morocco

Our mission: Bring luxury perfumery to everyone at fair prices.
No middlemen. No boutiques. No waste. 100% artisanal.

We use 113 premium oils. Every single one is used in our 24 elixirs.
Zero waste. Zero compromise.

"صنع في المغرب" - Made in Morocco

BRAND VALUES
=============
1. ZERO WASTE - 113 oils in, 113 oils out
2. SCIENTIFIC PRECISION - 90-day stability tested
3. MOROCCAN HERITAGE - Traditional craftsmanship + modern science
4. TRANSPARENCY - 2 prices, clear formulas, no secrets
5. QUALITY - 35-40% oil concentration vs 5-10% in mass market

