PRODUCTION WORKFLOW
====================
1. Select 4 oils per formula
2. Measure with syringe (4.375ml each for 99dh, 5ml each for 129dh)
3. Add DPG (6ml for 99dh, 7.5ml for 129dh)
4. Stir 3 minutes
5. Add Alcohol 96% (26.5ml for 99dh, 22.5ml for 129dh)
6. Fill to 50ml
7. Macerate 14 days (ELIXIR 35) or 21 days (ELIXIR OUD 40)
8. Shake every 3 days
9. Filter once
10. White Shirt Test
11. Add sprayer
12. Label and box
13. Quality check
14. Ship or sell

QUALITY CONTROL CHECKLIST
==========================
□ All 4 oils measured correctly
□ DPG amount correct (6ml or 7.5ml)
□ Alcohol level at 50ml mark
□ Maceration time met (14 or 21 days)
□ Shaken every 3 days
□ Filtered once
□ White Shirt Test passed (0 stain)
□ Smell test passed (18h+ on skin)
□ Label applied correctly
□ Box sealed

